founder | Last one standing: {player}! {project} has a founder, and it's too late to object.
founder | All hail {player}, Founder & CEO of {project}. Update your LinkedIn tonight.
founder | {player} takes it all! From sprint planning to the corner office in 20 minutes.
founder | The demo is over and {player} is the boss. First decision as CEO: more gløgg.
launchBuilding | Deploying {project} to prod! Hold your breath. Nobody touch anything.
launchBuilding | The AI is building {project} right now. It read all your cards. All of them.
launchBuilding | We are building! Your smashed cards are becoming real features. Sorry in advance.
launchBuilding | Build in progress. Yes, at a party. Yes, straight to prod.
launchBuilding | {project} is compiling. Your selfies are in there somewhere. Smile!
launchBuilding | The pipeline is running! If it fails, we all act like that was the plan.
launchReveal | IT'S LIVE! {project} is on the internet. We actually did it!
launchReveal | The curtain drops! Ladies and gentlemen: {project}. Find yourself on the team page.
launchReveal | There it is: {project}. Built tonight, by you, against all advice.
launchReveal | {project} has launched! Check the roadmap for everything you didn't finish.
launchReveal | Go-live! No rollback plan, no regrets. Open the link on your phone.
launchReveal | And the client is... speechless? {project} is live, and it actually works.
retroStart | Retro time! What went well, what went badly, and who gets an award for it.
retroStart | It's the retro! Everybody gets an award. Some of them are compliments.
retroStart | Welcome to the retrospective. Tonight the sticky notes are replaced by prizes.
retroStart | The Retro! We kept stats on all of you. Every. Single. One.
retroStart | Time for awards! Remember: this is a blameless retro. Mostly.
retroStart | Retro: glad, sad, mad. Tonight mostly glad, with a little gløgg.
tallyOffice | Office wins the night! Points to the people who found the building.
tallyOffice | The office takes it! Turns out commuting was worth it. Once.
tallyOffice | Office beats Remote! Free coffee and real chairs finally pay off.
tallyOffice | Victory for the room! Remote, you were great, but you were also on mute.
tallyOffice | Team Office wins! The hybrid debate is settled until Monday morning.
tallyOffice | Office wins! Please celebrate loudly so the holograms can hear it.
tallyRemote | REMOTE WINS! The holograms take it, from the sofa, in slippers!
tallyRemote | Team Remote wins! Zero commute, full points, blanket on.
tallyRemote | The dialled-in team wins Office vs Remote! The office has no comment.
tallyRemote | The home office takes the win! Somebody tell Facility we need fewer desks.
tallyRemote | Remote wins the night! All of it done between two loads of laundry.
tallyRemote | The holograms win! Best connection they've had all year.]]></Value>
    </commentatorLines>
    <prelobbyBriefings>
      <Value><![CDATA[1 | OPERATION | Risalamande. ████ (not about dessert. mostly)
1 | COVER STORY | a perfectly ordinary julefrokost
1 | TRUE NATURE | ████ (a game. you did not read that here)
1 | BUDGET | ████ (classified. also, small)
1 | CLEARANCE | yours was a clerical error. welcome
1 | CLIENT | ████ (definitely not a horse)
1 | DRESS CODE | inconspicuous. so: a Christmas jumper
1 | EQUIPMENT | one phone, fully charged. this is not a drill
1 | RENDEZVOUS | when the countdown hits zero. come alone (with everyone)
1 | CONTACT | a commentator. overexcited. knows your name
1 | EXTRACTION | if knocked out, you are promoted. we do not make the rules
1 | EVIDENCE | a real website will exist afterwards. you are on it
1 | THE PACKAGE | one almond. whoever finds it gets a real mandelgave
1 | ENDGAME | one of you leaves as Founder & CEO. nobody knows who
2 | PROJECT | a game. on your phone. there, we said it
2 | SECRECY | none. the black bars are a printer fault
2 | BUDGET | public record. ████ (the printer again)
2 | RISALAMANDE | a legitimate topic. raise it in every meeting
2 | DRESS CODE | Christmas jumper. ironic or sincere, we will not ask
2 | CLIENT | ████ (a horse. we can say that now)
2 | EQUIPMENT | one charged phone. remind the others to charge theirs
2 | WHEN | see the countdown. put it in a shared calendar
2 | PITCHES | you may submit your own idea. bad ones do well
2 | ROUNDS | four. you can be knocked out. it is a promotion
2 | REMOTE STAFF | attend as holograms. yes, really
2 | OUTPUT | one real website, built live. you are all on it
2 | ALMOND | there is exactly one. the prize is a real mandelgave
2 | WINNER | the last one standing is Founder & CEO. tell your family
3 | PROJECT | was ████. now a game. see the change log
3 | SCOPE | one evening. ████ (was: one quick meeting)
3 | BUDGET | unchanged. ████ (it was never approved)
3 | ESTIMATE | 3 story points. possibly 13
3 | CLIENT | has notes. had notes before we started
3 | DRESS CODE | Christmas jumper (v2). the suit was descoped
3 | DEADLINE | see the countdown. this one does not move
3 | EQUIPMENT | one phone, charged. added in revision 3
3 | OUT OF SCOPE | tilt controls, testing, your dignity
3 | DEPENDENCIES | the wifi. we have raised a ticket
3 | ROLE CHANGES | frequent. knocked out means promoted
3 | DELIVERABLE | one real website, built live. no feedback rounds
3 | LATE ADDITION | one almond. the finder gets a real mandelgave
3 | ACCEPTANCE | last one standing is Founder & CEO. no re-test
4 | MODULE | Festive Conduct ████ (a game. keep clicking)
4 | LEARNING GOAL | none. attendance is still expected
4 | BUDGET | see module 7 (there is no module 7)
4 | DRESS CODE | Christmas jumper. this will be on the test
4 | DURATION | ████ (longer than the progress bar suggests)
4 | EQUIPMENT | one phone, charged. a flat battery is non-compliant
4 | HAZARDS | scope creep, loose cables, the client
4 | GROUP WORK | yes. everyone at once, in front of one big screen
4 | REMOTE LEARNERS | attend as holograms. cameras optional
4 | ASSESSMENT | four rounds. fail one and you are promoted
4 | COURSE MATERIAL | one real website, built live, featuring you
4 | BONUS QUESTION | where is the almond? (prize: a real mandelgave)
4 | FEEDBACK FORM | everyone gets an award. that is the form
4 | CERTIFICATION | one of you graduates as Founder & CEO
5 | ITEM 1 | The Project ████ (a game. decided in the corridor)
5 | PRESENT | everyone who matters. also ████
5 | APOLOGIES | the budget
5 | DECISION | Christmas jumpers. carried. one abstention (legal)
5 | DISCUSSION | is the client a horse? parked until Q1
5 | ACTION | everyone to charge one phone. owner: you
5 | RISK LOG | the wifi. raised, noted, parked
5 | TIMELINE | see the countdown. nobody objected in time
5 | ESCALATION | to Otto. Otto has a request. it is large and round
5 | RESOURCING | the first ones knocked out join Management. as usual
5 | DELIVERABLE | one real website, built live. demo first, tests never
5 | AOB | one almond exists. the finder gets a real mandelgave
5 | OUTCOME | the last one standing becomes Founder & CEO
5 | NEXT MEETING | could have been an email. it is a party instead
6 | PROJECT | ████ (a game. the nisse was not consulted)
6 | AUTHOR | a nisse. lives behind the server rack. do not look
6 | BUDGET | one bowl of porridge. butter on top. non-negotiable
6 | GRIEVANCE | someone unplugged it and plugged it back in
6 | DRESS CODE | Christmas jumper. the red hat was the nisse's idea
6 | CLIENT | ████ (taller than the nisse. everyone is)
6 | EQUIPMENT | one phone, charged. the nisse will not lend its charger
6 | WHEN | when the countdown ends. the nisse keeps time
6 | RISKS | the wifi. the nisse says it was not the nisse
6 | BUGS | there will be bugs. the nisse is proud of each one
6 | PROMOTIONS | being knocked out is a promotion. the nisse laughed
6 | HANDIWORK | one real website, built live, with you on it
6 | THE ALMOND | hidden by the nisse. the finder gets a real mandelgave
6 | LAST WORD | last one standing is Founder & CEO. the nisse stays CTO
7 | SERVICE | julefrokost ████ (legacy. no documentation)
7 | CHANGE | moving it to a game on your phone. what could go wrong
7 | BUDGET | pay as you go. ████ (nobody set a limit)
7 | WINDOW | see the countdown. yes, it is a Friday deploy
7 | DOWNTIME | none planned. ████ (some planned)
7 | DRESS CODE | Christmas jumper. it is in the runbook
7 | CLIENT DEVICE | one phone, charged. it worked on our machine
7 | DEPENDENCIES | the wifi. one almond. everyone you work with
7 | KNOWN ISSUES | bugs. they cost points. we shipped them anyway
7 | SCALING | everyone at once. remote colleagues load as holograms
7 | FAILOVER | the first ones knocked out fail over to Management
7 | OUTPUT | one real website, deployed live, with you on it
7 | EASTER EGG | one almond. the finder gets a real mandelgave
7 | ROLLBACK | none. the last one standing becomes Founder & CEO
8 | COVER STORY | timesheets. nobody reads past that word
8 | REAL SUBJECT | ████ (a game. keep it out of the comment field)
8 | PROJECT CODE | ████ (not billable. we checked twice)
8 | BUDGET | 0 hours. already overrun
8 | HOURS | one Friday evening in December. round up
8 | DRESS CODE | Christmas jumper. not deductible
8 | CLIENT | ████ (internal. worse)
8 | EQUIPMENT | one phone, charged. charging is not billable either
8 | OVERTIME | expected. unpaid. enjoyable
8 | UTILISATION | everyone, 100%, for one evening only
8 | PROMOTION | granted when you are knocked out. no pay review
8 | EXPENSES | one almond. the finder gets a real mandelgave
8 | INVOICE | one real website, built live, with you on it
8 | YEAR-END | the last one standing is Founder & CEO. log it
9 | COMPANY | ████ (not founded yet. it's a game. invest anyway)
9 | VALUATION | one mandelgave, pre-money
9 | BUDGET | your attention, one evening. no cash changes hands
9 | PRODUCT | undecided. the room votes. you may pitch your own
9 | MARKET | ████ (possibly horses)
9 | DRESS CODE | Christmas jumper. the hoodie comes after funding
9 | DUE DILIGENCE | bring one charged phone. that is the whole process
9 | BURN RATE | one Friday evening in December
9 | RUNWAY | four rounds. most of you will not see the last one
9 | EXIT STRATEGY | being knocked out. it is a promotion, so: an exit
9 | BOARD SEAT | anyone knocked out gets to bet on the final
9 | TRACTION | one real website, live by the end of the night
9 | DIVIDEND | one almond. the finder gets a real mandelgave
9 | FOUNDER & CEO | vacant. goes to the last one standing
10 | INCIDENT | ████ (a game. it will get out of hand)
10 | STATUS | not started. already escalated
10 | DETECTED | when the countdown ends. by everyone, at once
10 | ROOT CAUSE | ████ (you. it is blameless, but: you)
10 | BUDGET | spent on this report
10 | DRESS CODE | Christmas jumper. it is in all the evidence
10 | IMPACT | everyone. phones, one big screen, some dignity
10 | FIRST RESPONSE | charge your phone. it is always the action item
10 | CONTRIBUTING | the wifi. the client. a horse, allegedly
10 | TIMELINE | four rounds. three of them knock people out
10 | MITIGATION | the knocked out are promoted until harmless
10 | ARTEFACT | one real website, built live. you are in it
10 | NEAR MISS | one almond. the finder gets a real mandelgave
10 | RESOLUTION | the last one standing becomes Founder & CEO
11 | SUBJECT | you. ████ (soon: someone else)
11 | REASON | you saw the word 'game'. you cannot unsee it
11 | NEW NAME | your choice. sign below to claim it early
11 | NEW JOB TITLE | you pick one on the night. none of them are real
11 | BUDGET | covers one name tag. laminated
11 | DRESS CODE | Christmas jumper. everyone in hiding wears one
11 | PHOTO | one selfie, optional. it goes on a real website. we know
11 | HANDOVER | when the countdown ends. come as you were
11 | EQUIPMENT | one phone, charged. a burner is not required
11 | NEIGHBOURS | everyone you work with. also relocated. act natural
11 | REMOTE WITNESSES | relocated as holograms
11 | IF COMPROMISED | you are knocked out and promoted. same thing
11 | STASH | one almond. the finder gets a real mandelgave
11 | FINAL IDENTITY | one of you becomes Founder & CEO. no going back
12 | ROLE | Founder & CEO. ████ (one opening. it's a game)
12 | COMPANY | ████ (to be founded during the interview)
12 | SALARY | competitive. ████ (with what, we cannot say)
12 | INTERVIEW | four rounds. the last one is a live demo
12 | DRESS CODE | Christmas jumper. we said smart casual. we meant this
12 | START DATE | see the countdown. immediate start
12 | REQUIREMENTS | one phone, charged. ten years of experience with it
12 | REFERENCES | your colleagues. they are also candidates. awkward
12 | CULTURE FIT | you may pitch an idea. bad ones do well
12 | REJECTION | comes as a promotion. to Management, or worse
12 | REMOTE | remote candidates are interviewed as holograms
12 | PORTFOLIO | one real website, built live, with you on it
12 | PERKS | one almond. the finder gets a real mandelgave
12 | FEEDBACK | every candidate gets an award. it is that kind of firm
13 | DESTINATION | ████ (a game. we land in production)
13 | DEPARTURE | when the countdown ends. gate: the julefrokost
13 | FARE | paid. ████ (do not ask by whom)
13 | DRESS CODE | Christmas jumper. it doubles as a flotation device
